. METHANOL IS ONE OF A NUMBER OF ALTERNATIVE MARINE FUELS AVAILABLE TO THE GLOBAL SHIPPING INDUSTRY.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-10-25 10:05:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES MAKES BUSINESS TRAVEL MORE REWARDING WITH NEW RAPID REWARDS BUSINESS PROGRAM', 'text': "DALLAS, OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) IS MAKING BUSINESS TRAVEL MORE REWARDING BY LAUNCHING RAPID REWARDS® BUSINESS, GIVING BUSINESSES THE ABILITY TO EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS AS THEIR TRAVELERS RETURN TO THE SKY. BY JOINING RAPID REWARDS BUSINESS, COMPANIES EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS THAT CAN BE APPLIED TOWARD TRAVEL ON THE COMPANY'S BEHALF, WHILE TRAVELERS WHO ARE RAPID REWARDS MEMBERS ALSO EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS IN THEIR PERSONAL ACCOUNTS."}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-10-25 15:37:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET TO APPOINT BRAD HU TO CHIEF RISK OFFICER', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NAMED BRAD HU ITS CHIEF RISK OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2022. HU SUCCEEDS ANDREW KURITZKES, WHO IS RETIRING FROM STATE STREET. HU WILL JOIN THE COMPANY IN NOVEMBER AS A MEMBER OF ITS EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE FOR A TRANSITION PERIOD WITH KURITZKES. HU WAS PREVIOUSLY THE CHIEF RISK OFFICER AT CITIGROUP FOR EIGHT YEARS, WHERE HE WAS CREDITED WITH SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCING THE FIRM'S RISK PROFILE WHILE GUIDING IT T"}{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2021-10-25 10:21:00', 'title': "ATREG SUCCESSFULLY ASSISTS TEXAS INSTRUMENTS WITH ACQUISITION OF MICRON'S OPERATIONAL 300MM FAB BASED IN LEHI, UTAH", 'text': 'SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TEXAS INSTRUMENTS CLOSES ACQUISITION OF OPERATIONAL 300MM WAFER FAB LOCATED IN LEHI, UT WITH THE ASSISTANCE OF GLOBAL TRANSACTION ADVISORS ATREG, INC.'}{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2021-10-25 16:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC TAKES ADDITIONAL ACTION TO ALLEVIATE SUPPLY CHAIN CONGESTION', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB., OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0UNION PACIFIC RAILROAD TODAY ANNOUNCED ADDITIONAL PROACTIVE STE